The '''Bayaran Republican Party''' ({{Langx|an|Partido Republicano Bayarés}}, '''PRB''') was a Bayaran {{W|political party}} founded in August 1848. Under the [[Republics of Balisca|republican system]] at the time, the patron-client political machines of the countryside enabled agrarian oligarchs, especially land-owning elites in [[Carpinchera]] (the most economically powerful and most-populous province), to dominate state structures to their advantage, particularly the weak central state structures that effectively devolved power to local agrarian oligarchies. 

